{"id":"word:hebrew:H4217","type":"word","title":"מִזְרָח","subtitle":"H4217 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"sunrise , i.e. the east","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to מִזְרָח (H4217) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 74 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"מִזְרָח (mizrâch) means sunrise , i.e. the east First listed occurrence: 1Chr 4 39."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"מִזְרָח","transliteration":"mizrâch","pronunciation":"miz-rawkh'","strong":"H4217","lemmaId":"hebrew:H4217","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["מִזְרָ֔חָ/ה","מִ/מִּזְרַח","מִזְרָֽחָ/ה","מִזְרָ֖חָ/ה","מִזְרַ֣ח"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa/Sd",27],["HR/Ncmsc",11],["HNcmsc",8],["HNcmsa",7],["HR/Ncmsa",7],["HRd/Ncmsa",3],["HTd/Ncmsa",3],["HNcmsc/Sd",3],["HC/Rd/Ncmsa",2],["HRd/Ncmsa/Sd",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"sunrise , i.e. the east","usage":"east (side, -ward), (sun-) rising (of the sun).","full":"H4217. mizrach מִזְרָח noun [masculine] place of sunrise, east — absolute ׳מ Josh 11:3 21 t.; construct מִזְרַח Num 21:10 19 t., with ה locative מִזְרָ֫חָה Exod 27:13 28t., construct מִזְרְחָה Deut 4:41 ; Josh 12:1 ; Judg 21:19 (not in Genesis Leviticus Samuel Ezekiel etc.); &#8212; 1 sunrise always of quarter of the heavens = east ׳מ (ה)שׁמשׁ Num 21:11 (P), Deut 4:41 , 47 ; Josh 1:15 ; 12:1 ; 13:5 (all D), 19:12 , 27 , 34 (all P), Judg 20:43 ; 21:19 ; 2Kin 10:33 ; Isa 41:25 ; 45:6 ; 59:19 , compare ׳מ לארץ שׁמשׁ Judg 11:18 ; ׳מִמִּז וְעַדמְֿבוֺאוֺ שׁמשׁ Psa 50:1 ; 113:3 ; Mal 1:11 ; more often 2 without שֶׁמֶשׁ : a. the east מִמַּעֲרָב֑ מ ׳כִּרְחֹק Psa 103:12 . b. ׳מִמּ from the east Isa 41:2 ; 43:5 (opposed to מִמַּעֲרָב ), 46:11 ; Dan 11:44 (+ מִצַּפוֺן ); וּמִיָּם מִצָּפוֺן וּמִמַּעֲרָב֑ ׳מִמּ Psa 107:3 . c. to or toward the place of sunrise, to the east, eastward: -1 מִוְרָ֫חָה Num 32:19 (P), Deut 3:17 , 27 , 1Chr 26:17 (+ לַנֶּ֫גְבָּה לַצָּפ֫וֺנָה, ), Neh 3:26 ; לַמִּזְרָ֫חָה 2Chr 31:14 ; (4) ׳אֶלהַֿמּ Dan 8:9 (+ אֶלהַֿצֶּבִ֑י אֶלהַֿנֶּגֶב, ); (5) רָךְ עַדמִֿזְ וּמִצָּפוֺן עָדיָֿם מִיָּם Amos 8:12 . d. (on) the east side of, construct יְרִיחוֺ מִזְרַה קְצֵה Josh 4:19 (P); also with לְ הַנָּ֑יְא לְמִזְרַח 1Chr 4:39 , ׳לְמ הַיַּרְדֵּן 6:63 ; with ׳מִמִּז מִן, Josh 11:3 (opposed to מִיָּם ) compare 17:10 (+ מצָּפוֺן ; both J E), also 16:6 (P). e. after a construct מ ׳עַלכָּֿלמְּֿנֵי לגלעד 1Chr 5:10 ; הַמּ ׳רְחוֺב 2Chr 29:4 ; הַמּ ׳שַׁעַר Neh 3:29 ; מ ׳אֶרֶץ Zech 8:7 (opposed to הַשֶּׁמֶשׁ מְבוֺא ארץ ).","rootNote":"from 2224 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 4 39","keyReferences":["1Chr 4 39","1Chr 5 9","1Chr 5 10","1Chr 6 63","1Chr 7 28","1Chr 9 18","1Chr 9 24","1Chr 12 16"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":74,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 4 39","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":39,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/מִזְרַ֣ח","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 5 9","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/לַ/מִּזְרָ֗ח","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Rd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 5 10","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִזְרָ֥ח","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 6 63","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":63,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/מִזְרַ֣ח","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 7 28","book":"1Chr","chapter":7,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/לַ/מִּזְרָ֣ח","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Rd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 9 18","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִזְרָ֑חָ/ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa/Sd"},{"reference":"1Chr 9 24","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִזְרָ֥ח","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 12 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":12,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWo